  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<p>这个模组为睡眠提供了一些额外的益处。</p>\n<h2>功能<br><br></h2>\n<p><strong>睡眠恢复生命<br></strong>在床上睡觉会按可配置的量恢复玩家的生命值。<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>药水效果重置<br></strong>睡眠会治愈负面和正面的药水效果。每种类型都可以在配置文件中单独禁用。<br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>喜欢这个模组并想支持我？</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/DarkhaxDev\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a>&nbsp;上关注我</li>\n<li>加入我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n<li>在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>&nbsp;上支持我</li>\n<li>查看我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">网站</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://nodecraft.com/assets/images/logo-dark.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"90\"></a><br>该项目由 Nodecraft 赞助。使用代码&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Darkhax</a>&nbsp;可享受第一个月服务 30% 的折扣！<img src=\"https://skulk.blmj.red/bed-benefits\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Logo 由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgame-icons.net%252f1x1%252fdelapouite%252fbed.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delapouite</a> 在 Game Icons 上制作，并根据 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC By 3.0</a> 授权。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
